  speakerName: ''
  storyText: "The heavy door gives way. The air is thick and stinging with industrial bleach. A single failing fluorescent tube flickers on bare concrete.\n\nHeavy metal racks line the room, packed with maintenance supplies. In the center, a yellow mop bucket is tipped over, a dark smear leading toward the back corner. A metal desk sits buried under blueprints and a logbook."
  narrativeBeats: []
  dialogueLines:
  - introNarration: "The heavy steel maintenance door screeches open into harsh bleach air."
    speakerName: "YOU"
    side: 0
    avatarSprite: {fileID: 0}
    animatedAvatarFrames: []
    avatarFPS: 8
    dialogueText: "Carl locked himself in here because he was feeling feverish. His joints were burning. He never clocked out."
    outroNarration: "The fluorescent bulb buzzes erratically overhead."
    requiresStoryFlag: ''
    requiresNotFlag: ''
